(7466045, 1184683, 113591, '<td valign="top"><strike>Laughter is such a pretty emotion.<br/>Not that I''m saying your strong face is ugly, because it isn''t..<br/>Not that you with a veil is hideous, not by a long shot...<br/>What I was trying to say was that when you laugh you look much prettier than.....<br/></strike> <br/>Damn fine woman<br/></td>', 'Laughter is such a pretty emotion.Not that I''m saying your strong face is ugly, because it isn''t..Not that you with a veil is hideous, not by a long shot...What I was trying to say was that when you laugh you look much prettier than..... Damn fine woman', '2016-07-27 03:08:07.000000', NULL, 0),
